{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28695","headline":"酬许十三秀才兼依来韵 · 杜牧","name":"酬许十三秀才兼依来韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"多爲裁诗步竹轩，有时凝思过朝昏。\n篇成敢道怀金璞，吟苦唯应似岭猿。\n迷兴每慙花月夕，寄愁长在别离魂。\n凭君把卷侵寒烛，丽句时传画戟门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}